2. The photos
-------------

public/images/ is expressly NOT covered by this. All rights reserved.

These photographs show identifiable people. They are published with those
people's consent for this site — and for this site. That consent does not
extend to any reuse elsewhere, and we could not grant it on their behalf
anyway.

If you would like to use one of the photos, ask first: info@impro-sturmfrei.de

If you see yourself in a photo and do not want it there, write to the same
address — we will take it down, without explanation and without asking back.


3. The fonts
------------

public/fonts/ contains Anton and Inter. Both are under the SIL Open Font
License 1.1 and belong to their respective authors; they only sit here
because the site serves them itself instead of fetching them from Google.
